      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh wow, okay, 120mg sounds like it'll definitely do the trick. i'll go grab the salt and water now. i'm a little nervous about the throat thing though, it's starting to feel a bit more like it's closing up than just being scratchy. \n\nit's probably just the swelling from the pollen, right? if i start feeling really sleepy or like i'm drifting off, is that just the 120mg finally kicking in? i'll just lie down on the couch and wait for it to pass.",
